@startuml
title <size:18><b>MinaMatch - Estados de Autenticacion JWT</b></size>

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  RoundCorner 12
}

state "UNAUTHENTICATED\nUsuario no autenticado" as UNAUTH
state "AUTHENTICATED\nUsuario autenticado\n(user, token en localStorage)" as AUTH
state "GUEST\nInvitado\nToken: guest-token\nRole: guest\nSin JWT real" as GUEST
state "LOADING\nVerificando token persistido\nApp.tsx:46 -> spinner" as LOADING
state "TOKEN_EXPIRED\nToken invalido o expirado\nLimpia localStorage\nRedirige a Login" as EXPIRED
state "OFFLINE_FALLBACK\nLogin offline\nServidor no disponible\nCredenciales hardcodeadas\nToken: local-jwt-simulated" as OFFLINE

[*] --> LOADING : App inicia

LOADING --> AUTH : localStorage tiene token valido\n-> GET /api/auth/me -> 200
LOADING --> GUEST : localStorage tiene "guest-token"\n-> setUser invitado (sin JWT)
LOADING --> UNAUTH : localStorage vacio\n-> App.tsx:55 -> LandingPage

UNAUTH --> LOADING : Usuario hace login\n-> AuthContext.login()
UNAUTH --> GUEST : Click "Entrar como invitado"\n-> AuthContext.loginAsGuest()

AUTH --> EXPIRED : API responde 401\n-> localStorage.removeItem()\n-> setUser(null)
EXPIRED --> UNAUTH : Redirige a Login (user == null)

AUTH --> UNAUTH : Logout explicito\n-> localStorage.removeItem()
AUTH --> OFFLINE : Fallback offline\n-> fetch falla, usa credenciales locales
OFFLINE --> UNAUTH : Logout

GUEST --> AUTH : Hace login real\n-> reemplaza token guest

note right of LOADING
  src/AuthContext.tsx:28-61
  useEffect al montar:
  - Lee localStorage
  - Si guest-token -> setUser
  - Si JWT -> GET /api/auth/me
  - Si falla -> limpia
  - Si vacio -> no login
end note

note left of AUTH
  Flujo exitoso:
  POST /api/auth/login
  jwt.sign(payload, JWT_SECRET, {expiresIn: '24h'})
  HS256
  Devuelve {token, user}
  localStorage + setUser
end note

note left of GUEST
  Modo invitado:
  authMiddleware.ts:24
  if (token === "guest-token") {
    req.user = { role: "guest", ... }
    return next()
  }
  Util para PMV/demos
  Sin JWT real
end note

@enduml
